About This Repository
This repository documents my learning journey through a 16-lesson Claude AI Mastery Programme.
Learning Objectives
Understand Claude AI and its capabilities.
Use Claude for research and information gathering.
Understand GitHub and version control.
Create and use custom AI skills.
Explore Claude's memory and project features.
Use AI to improve productivity and automate workflows.
Create professional documents and digital content.
Course Structure
Week 1: Connectors, Research and GitHub.
Week 2: Custom Skills and Memory.
Week 3: Artifacts, Cowork and Design.
Week 4: Workflows and Long Documents.
Learning Progress
Lesson 1: Completed.
Lesson 2: Completed.
Lesson 3: In Progress.
